 including experimental music and performance\, appearing at international 
 festivals and significant presenting engagements outside the United States
 . GRANT: up to USD 11\,000 toward eligible travel and engagement expenses\
 , matched 1:1.\n\nOrganisation: Mid Atlantic Arts\, with the National Endo
 wment for the Arts and the Mellon Foundation\nLocation: Baltimore\, Maryla
 nd\, USA (administration). RESTRICTED: artists and ensembles based in any 
 US state or territory\, performing at engagements outside the US.\nAward: 
 Grants of up to USD 11\,000 toward eligible expenses\, with a 1:1 cost mat
 ch required. No application fee.\nDuration: Projects 1 July 2027 to 30 Aug
 ust 2028\n\nMore: https://www.midatlanticarts.org/grants-programs/usartist
 s-international/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
